{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"拟三角代数"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"拟三角代数"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"双代数","text":"双代数"}},{"Plain":"上的<strong>拟三角</strong> (quasitriangular) 结构是使其"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数上的模","text":"模"}},{"Plain":"范畴由"},{"Local":{"url":"幺半范畴","text":"幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":"升级为"},{"Local":{"url":"辫幺半范畴","text":"辫幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":"所需的结构.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>拟三角代数是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Hopf代数","text":"Hopf 代数"}},{"Plain":" $A$ 配备 $R\\in A^{\\otimes 2}$ (或某种完备化的元素), 满足</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\sigma\\Delta a = R \\cdot \\Delta a \\cdot R^{-1}$, 其中 $\\sigma$ 交换两个分量;</li>\n<li>$(\\Delta\\otimes\\mathrm{id}) R = R_{13} R_{12}$;</li>\n<li>$(\\mathrm{id}\\otimes\\Delta) R = R_{13} R_{23}$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>$U_h \\mathfrak {sl}_2$ 为拟三角代数.</p>\n"}]}}